Auto-resolve DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH for nginz on Apple Silicon (arm64) macOS dev setups. `.envrc` now locates nginx's compiled-in zauth dylib in the Nix store and exports DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH automatically (cached against the dev-env rebuild), so `direnv allow` + `make cr` starts nginz without manual steps. See docs/src/developer/developer/running-locally-macos-arm64.md for the full local macOS dev setup.
